{
    "title": "PrizePicks - Fantasy Sports",
    "description": "PrizePicks - Daily Fantasy Sports\r\n\r\nNew Users: Play $5, Get $50 Instantly! Sign up today - use code Play2Day\r\n\r\nPrizePicks is the simplest, fastest, & most exciting daily fantasy sports game. You choose 2+ players and pick the more/less on their projection - then watch the money roll in! \r\n\r\nWHY PRIZEPICKS?\r\n\r\nPrizePicks is the simplest and most fun way to play daily fantasy sports! Offering a wide range of sports, players, and stat types, PrizePicks has you covered for all of your daily fantasy sports fun.\r\n\r\nPrizePicks is a simple and fast real money fantasy sports game. Our \u201cpick \u2018em\u201d fantasy sports game also has many promos, an electric member community, and everything you need to have the best fantasy sports experience.\r\n\r\nThe ways to play are nearly infinite. You can combine an NFL QB\u2019s TDs with the FTs of an NBA player. Then, combine those with 2 of your favorite golf stars. The possibilities are endless and so is the fun. Just ask our millions of users.\r\n\r\nUNLIMITED FANTASY SPORTS OPTIONS\r\n\r\nThere is something for everyone - ranging from the fantasy football diehard to the casual sports fan. We offer an industry-leading amount of sports for you to play:\r\n\r\n- Fantasy Football\r\n- Fantasy College Football\r\n- Fantasy Basketball\r\n- Fantasy College Basketball - Fantasy WNBA\r\n- Fantasy esports\r\n- Fantasy Baseball\r\n- Fantasy Golf\r\n- Fantasy Hockey\r\n- Fantasy Tennis\r\n- Fantasy Soccer\r\n- Fantasy MMA & UFC\r\n\r\n& many more!\r\n\r\nPrizePicks is the first daily fantasy sports company to offer MIXED SPORT LINEUPS. That means you can win big on a lineup that combines players from the NFL, NCAAF, CFL, CFB, NBA, WNBA CBB, PGA, MLB, NHL, EPL, MLS, esports & more.\r\n\r\nHUGE PAYOUTS:\r\n\r\nOn PrizePicks, you can win big with our real money fantasy sports game. Play it safe by picking 2-3 projections or go for bigger payouts by selecting more. Anyone can get 10x their lineup by just getting predictions correct.\r\n\r\nSAFE & SECURE WITHDRAWALS:\r\n\r\nWhen you win, you can withdraw your cash instantly and easily. Within 48 hours, your cash will be back in your account! If you win an NFL Fantasy lineup on Monday night, you\u2019ll have the cash back in your account before the Thursday & Sunday games!\r\n\r\nWHO CAN PLAY?\r\n\r\nUS and Canada residents only (excluding Ontario).\r\n\r\nPrizePicks Pick 'Em\r\nAvailable to residents 19+ in AR,CA,GA,IL,IN,MN,NE,NM,NC,ND,OK,RI,SC,SD,TX,UT,VT,VA,WI, District of Columbia & Canada (excluding Ontario)\r\nSelect more/less on 2-6 projections, choose Flex Play (1 or 2 picks can lose) or Power Play (all must win) and then lock in your lineup for big payouts.\r\n\r\nPrizePicks Pick 'Em Arena\r\nAvailable to residents 18+ in AK,FL,KS,KY,NH,OR,TN,WV & WY. 19+ in AL,CO.21+ in AZ & MA\r\nSelect more/less on 2-6 projections and submit your lineup. Lineups are placed into groups according to member skill level, lineup fee, number of projections selected, and time of lineup submission. Members win by selecting a perfect lineup or by having the best lineup in the group.\r\n\r\nPrizePicks Streak\r\nAvailable to residents 19+ in CT,DE,IA,LA,MI,MO,MS,NJ,NY,OH PA\r\nStreak is the newest free-to-play game from PrizePicks, where you can turn daily picks into up to $1 million. Make your daily pick of More or Less on the day\u2019s top player projections, sweat out your pick and the more wins you stack, the higher your potential reward.\r\n\r\nPROMOTIONS:\r\n\r\nWe offer various promotions to help you maximize your winnings and enhance the fun. These include:\r\nSign Up Offers (Use Play2Day - Play $5 -> Get $50 Instantly)\r\n$25 Referral Bonus\r\nPayout Boosts*\r\nProtected plays*\r\nMystery PrizePacks*\r\n\r\n*Pick \u2018Em Only\r\n\r\nNot a gambling app. This is a real-money fantasy gaming app. Please practice responsible gaming and only play what you can afford. If you or someone you know has a gaming problem, get help. Crisis services and responsible gaming counseling can be accessed by calling 1-800-426-2537, 1-800-522-4700 or 1-800-NEXTSTEP for Arizona residents, or online at www.800gambler.org or www.ncpgambling.org.",
